.TH COUNT_FILES 1 "October 2026" "count-files 2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
count_files \- count files, directories and links in the specified directory or, if the parameter is not passed, in /etc
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B count_files
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B A Bash script that counts the number of files, directories and links in the
.B specified directory or, if the parameter is not passed, in the /etc directory
